"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Eleanor-Herbosch-2-scaled.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"227537e\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Detail of relief\" data-elementor-lightbox-description=\"- &lt;br&gt; Excavated clay, bricks, roof tiles and gravel\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MzY5LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvZ29sZGVuZWFydGhzdHVkaW8uY28udWtcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjNcLzA5XC9FbGVhbm9yLUhlcmJvc2NoLTItc2NhbGVkLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjIyNzUzN2UifQ%3D%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-gallery-image elementor-gallery-item__image\" data-thumbnail=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Eleanor-Herbosch-2-scaled.jpg\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"2560\" aria-label=\"\" role=\"img\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-gallery-item__overlay\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-gallery-item__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-gallery-item__title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetail of relief\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-gallery-item__description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- <br> Excavated clay, bricks, roof tiles and gravel\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f03961 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2f03961\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d7c6ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d7c6ac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08cdbd0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08cdbd0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5575a9e animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5575a9e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Which material(s) did you use from Golden Earth Studio? How did you incorporate it into your work? </h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9960984 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9960984\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In my paintings, I utilised the excavated clay, excess construction bricks and roof tiles obtained during the demolition process. Using the clay’s natural pigments, unique to the site, I was able to create a textural foundation directly into the canvas. I ground down the remaining materials into various compositions to be able to create the reliefs.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e23fe06 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e23fe06\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-809a7d2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"809a7d2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-804b4dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"804b4dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8f0159 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c8f0159\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> How did the origin of the material tie in with your philosophy? </h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d3274c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d3274c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Over time, my practice has evolved towards creating site-specific works of art. The philosophy of Golden Earth <br>Studios has aligned seamlessly with this approach.</p><p> </p><p>I take great pleasure in creating work that holds a special meaning or establishes a profound connection with my clients as it creates a much more collaborative and engaging dialogue. I work alone in my studio but this way I am able to share ideas prior to the making which I do enjoy.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4db857a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4db857a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6d6405 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d6d6405\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ce88bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7ce88bc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a2a4da animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7a2a4da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> In what aspects did the material inform your final piece? </h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d4e4a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0d4e4a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The most important outcome when working on these paintings was to preserve the essence of the location. <br>The background’s unique pigmentation is a direct representation of the qualities of materials excavated from <br>the site.</p><p>Working with materials as solid as brick and stone was a new exercise for me, both physically and <br>metaphorically!</p><p> </p><p>Despite not being accustomed to working with these new materials, I have been able to expand <br>my materials library, gaining a broader understanding of their potential in my artistic expression.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26e50dd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"26e50dd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ad1f3b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ad1f3b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8b43b6 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a8b43b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Explore Our Featured Artists</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23fb7d6 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"23fb7d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Golden Earth Studio works with established <br>artists, who’s practiced is deeply rooted in <br>material exploration. Skilfully translating their <br>knowledge and research into works of art.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f976b2e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f976b2e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element eleme